      "content": "Here is a more casual, urban-friendly template to build rapport with those demographics. This style uses warmer, direct language to feel more relatable instead of purely corporate. *Template: \"Hey! Quick heads-up on your order #[Order Number]—it's hit a little snag in shipping, sorry about that. Things are moving slower than expected right now, but we're on top of it and expect your goodies to land around [New Date/Timeframe]. We appreciate you hanging tight!\"*",
